cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "LP Modelling: linear programming models for Management Engineering"
abstract: >-
  Teaching material of the course LP Modelling: online lecture notes,
  Python/Gurobi code, data and case studies. Eleven chapters: linear
  programming background, solver usage, deterministic models, decisions under
  uncertainty, and robust and quantile regression. Every model is linear, with
  continuous variables only and a single solver.
